WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching light punches start the medium Tatsu route.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.950
Medium Tatsu knocks Ryu down at midscreen.

3
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.250
Akuma descends with jumping heavy kick as Ryu wakes up.

4
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.850
Ryu performs the recorded reversal while Akuma lands.

5
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.350
Akuma has blocked the reversal and remains beside Ryu.
